			"content": "I too have come to the same conclusion...\n\n\"kids increase your life’s emotional range. The highs are higher. The lows are lower. If you were living between a 3 and a 7 before, kids can extend you to a 1-10 (and sometimes they run the gamut in one ten minute stretch)\"\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/pandemic/\"></a>",
