			},
			"date": "2021-03-29T14:35:24.000Z",
			"content": "You've summed up my experience with the pandemic and my kids perfectly. It's given me deep introspection. I'm filled with gratitude about the time we've spent together, the highs and lows, and the coming to terms with the internal guilt of enjoying it against a terrible backdrop.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
